<article class="env-lemma" id="0DBE">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/0DBE">Lemma <span data-tag="0DBE">34.8.2</span>.</a> Let $\{ f_ j : U_ j \to T\} _{j = 1, \ldots , m}$ be a standard ph covering. Let $T' \to T$ be a morphism of affine schemes. Then $\{ U_ j \times _ T T' \to T'\} _{j = 1, \ldots , m}$ is a standard ph covering. </p>
</article><article class="env-proof">
    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
      Let $f : U \to T$ be proper surjective and let an affine open covering $U = \bigcup _{j = 1, \ldots , m} U_ j$ be given as in Definition <a href="/tag/0DBD" data-tag="0DBD">34.8.1</a>. Then $U \times _ T T' \to T'$ is proper surjective (Morphisms, Lemmas <a href="/tag/01S1" data-tag="01S1">29.9.4</a> and <a href="/tag/01W4" data-tag="01W4">29.42.5</a>). Also, $U \times _ T T' = \bigcup _{j = 1, \ldots , m} U_ j \times _ T T'$ is an affine open covering. This concludes the proof. 
      <span class="qed">$\square$</span>
    </p>
</article>